the old place settling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/7faae282823cbe01b0b239f811179ad9.poster.avif?t=1753460149\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/7faae282823cbe01b0b239f811179ad9.webm?t=1753460149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/7faae282823cbe01b0b239f811179ad9.mp4?t=1753460149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTENSE, IMMERSIVE JOURNEY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong><br>&quot;Walking Simulator&quot; focused on story, exploration, and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>The game presents different endings based on the choices you make\u2014can you find the truth behind what\u2019s happening, or will you lose yourself to the darkness around you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong><br>Aesthetic inspired by the 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong><br>You\u2019ll carry a powerful Polaroid camera that lets you capture hidden horrors\u2014things invisible to the naked eye\u2014and reveal the dark truths hidden within the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design</strong><br>The immersive sound design pulls you deeper into the experience, building tension at every moment until you\u2019re fully surrounded by a growing sense of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Elements</strong><br>Paranormal activity makes objects move and causes the environment to change in strange and unexpected ways, making you feel something beyond this world